From 0ca4b8577e96ba28c1af1973f52a25fdf366f57c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yaakov Selkowitz <yselkowi@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 30 Jun 2026 16:52:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: add ELN support to distros

ELN now identifies itself uniquely and more RHEL-like, rather than as a
variant of Fedora.

https://github.com/fedora-eln/eln/issues/565

Signed-off-by: Yaakov Selkowitz <yselkowi@redhat.com>
Signed-off-by: Jeremy Cline <jeremycline@microsoft.com>
---
